dot("$c_2$", C[2], S);
[/asy]

Four diagonals of a regular octagon with side length 2 intersect as shown.  Find the area of the shaded region. [asy]
pair A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H;
real x = 22.5;
pair A = dir(x);
pair B = dir(45+x);
pair C = dir(45*2+x);
pair D = dir(45*3+x);
pair E = dir(45*4+x);
pair F = dir(45*5+x);
pair G = dir(45*6+x);
pair H = dir(45*7+x);
draw(A--B--C--D--E--F--G--H--cycle);

draw(A--D--G);
draw(C--H--E);
